    mood_nauseous: "Sickness may result from unsafe food, corpse exposure, or infection. The moodle does not diagnose the cause; severe illness can drain health.",
    mood_ill: "Cold symptoms can weaken the character and interfere with exertion. Warmth and rest help while the illness runs its course.",
    status_injuredmajor: "One or more injuries are affecting the character. Movement or fighting may suffer; inspect the health panel and treat wounds directly.",
    status_bleeding: "An open wound is actively draining health. Bandage and treat the wound; watch for continued bleeding or infection.",
    status_wet: "Rain, sweat, or water has soaked the character. Wet clothing loses warmth faster, especially in wind or cold weather; dry off and change clothes.",
